er_id":"cultural_facilities","name":"塙町Ｂ＆Ｇ海洋センター","category":"public","address":"大字台宿字下川原28","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"07483","municipality_pref":"福島県","municipality_name":"塙町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[140.408444,36.953194]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"parks_playgrounds","name":"栄町児童公園","category":"nature","address":"東白川郡塙町","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"07483","municipality_pref":"福島県","municipality_name":"塙町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[140.41307828,36.95689665]}}],"display_comment_original":"塙町周辺には、近世村の記憶として塙村、下渋井村、上渋井村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には史跡や遺跡に関わる場所が見え、羽黒館跡のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板、塙村、下渋井村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに水辺の暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を示す案内板に加え、治水碑や河川改修の記念碑が狙い目になる。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":["白石義郎"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["漫画グランプリ","愛宕神社祭礼","湯遊ランドはなわ・オートキャンプ場","湯岐温泉","あぶくま高原美術館","はなわ漫画廊","道の駅はなわ","志保の湯温泉"],"specialties":["こんにゃく","こんにゃく餅","登り鮎","ダリア染め","りんご"],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A1%99%E7%94%BA","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q23940215"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"塙町","wikipedia_revision_id":"109747191","wikidata_qid":"Q1205922","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A1%99%E7%94%BA","japan_search_query_url":"","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}